      "id": "markdown-1",
      "kind": "text",
      "name": "Tasks gives people, external agents and Null basic shared…",
      "text": "Tasks gives people, external agents and Null basic shared tasks, with one set of operations for the browser, the HTTP API, MCP and the CLI. Each task belongs to one workspace, product or project, and anyone who can see that location can read and edit its tasks.",
