    {
      "padding": 0,
      "lineHeight": 1.5,
      "id": "markdown-3",
      "kind": "text",
      "name": "Every task has a mode—Plan or Build—separate from its…",
      "text": "Every task has a mode—Plan or Build—separate from its status. In Plan mode an agent writes a plan into the task and stops for review; Ready to build switches it to Build when a person decides the work should start. List, board and timeline views, sub-tasks, dependencies, drag and drop, @mentions, attachments and in-app notifications help a team follow the work, and Null can answer questions about tasks or change them in Work mode.",
      "assetId": null,
      "frame": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 3,
        "width": 12,
        "height": 1
      },
      "frames": {},
      "color": "transparent",
      "background": "transparent",
