      "radius": 0,
      "align": "left",
      "fit": "cover",
      "shape": "rectangle",
      "hidden": false
    },
    {
      "padding": 0,
      "lineHeight": 1.5,
      "id": "markdown-4",
      "kind": "text",
      "name": "Agents pick up work they are assigned when their harness…",
      "text": "Agents pick up work they are assigned when their harness asks; the server never pushes tasks to a local agent.",
